{"page":55,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:38","surah":3,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"هُنَالِكَ دَعَا زَكَرِيَّا رَبَّهُۥ ۖ قَالَ رَبِّ هَبْ لِى مِن لَّدُنكَ ذُرِّيَّةً طَيِّبَةً ۖ إِنَّكَ سَمِيعُ ٱلدُّعَآءِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There and then Zachariah prayed to his Lord, saying, ‘Lord, from Your grace grant me virtuous offspring: You hear every prayer.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"هُنَالِكَ","en_gloss":"There only","transliteration":"hunālika","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"دَعَا","en_gloss":"invoked","transliteration":"daʿā","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"زَكَرِيَّا","en_gloss":"Zakariya","transliteration":"zakariyyā","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَبَّهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"his Lord","transliteration":"rabbahu","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هَبْ","en_gloss":"grant","transliteration":"hab","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِى","en_gloss":"[for] me","transliteration":"lī","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّدُنكَ","en_gloss":"Yourself","transliteration":"ladunka","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ذُرِّيَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"offspring","transliteration":"dhurriyyatan","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"طَيِّبَةً ۖ","en_gloss":"pure","transliteration":"ṭayyibatan","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed, You","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سَمِيعُ","en_gloss":"(are) All-Hearer","transliteration":"samīʿu","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلدُّعَآءِ","en_gloss":"(of) the prayer","transliteration":"l-duʿāi","verse_key":"3:38"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:38"}]},{"verse_key":"3:39","surah":3,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"فَنَادَتْهُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ وَهُوَ قَآئِمٌ يُصَلِّى فِى ٱلْمِحْرَابِ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُبَشِّرُكَ بِيَحْيَىٰ مُصَدِّقًۢا بِكَلِمَةٍ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَسَيِّدًا وَحَصُورًا وَنَبِيًّا مِّنَ ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The angels called out to him, while he stood praying in the sanctuary, ‘God gives you news of John, confirming a Word from God. He will be noble and chaste, a prophet, one of the righteous.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَنَادَتْهُ","en_gloss":"Then called him","transliteration":"fanādathu","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"when he","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَآئِمٌۭ","en_gloss":"(was) standing ","transliteration":"qāimun","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُصَلِّى","en_gloss":"praying","transliteration":"yuṣallī","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمِحْرَابِ","en_gloss":"the prayer chamber","transliteration":"l-miḥ'rābi","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُبَشِّرُكَ","en_gloss":"gives you glad tidings","transliteration":"yubashiruka","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِيَحْيَىٰ","en_gloss":"of Yahya","transliteration":"biyaḥyā","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُصَدِّقًۢا","en_gloss":"confirming","transliteration":"muṣaddiqan","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِكَلِمَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"[of] a Word","transliteration":"bikalimatin","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَسَيِّدًۭا","en_gloss":"and a noble","transliteration":"wasayyidan","verse_key":"3:39"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَحَصُورًۭا","en_gloss":"and chaste","transliteration":"waḥ