ika","verse_key":"3:40"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:40"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَفْعَلُ","en_gloss":"does","transliteration":"yafʿalu","verse_key":"3:40"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:40"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"3:40"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٤٠","en_gloss":"(40)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:40"}]},{"verse_key":"3:41","surah":3,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ رَبِّ ٱجْعَل لِّىٓ ءَايَةً ۖ قَالَ ءَايَتُكَ أَلَّا تُكَلِّمَ ٱلنَّاسَ ثَلَـٰثَةَ أَيَّامٍ إِلَّا رَمْزًا ۗ وَٱذْكُر رَّبَّكَ كَثِيرًا وَسَبِّحْ بِٱلْعَشِىِّ وَٱلْإِبْكَـٰرِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He said, ‘My Lord, give me a sign.’ ‘Your sign,’ [the angel] said, ‘is that you will not communicate with anyone for three days, except by gestures. Remember your Lord often; celebrate His glory in the evening and at dawn.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"My Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱجْعَل","en_gloss":"make","transliteration":"ij'ʿal","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِّىٓ","en_gloss":"for me","transliteration":"lī","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَايَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"a sign","transliteration":"āyatan","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَايَتُكَ","en_gloss":"your sign","transliteration":"āyatuka","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"(is) that not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تُكَلِّمَ","en_gloss":"you will speak","transliteration":"tukallima","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ","en_gloss":"(to) the people","transliteration":"l-nāsa","verse_key":"3:41"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثَلَـٰثَةَ","en_gloss":"(for) three","transliteration":"thalāthata","verse_key":"3:41"},{"